{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/en/ep3/quest_story/13221010.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1322101001:0":{"text":"Carolina, we've come to visit!","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，卡列琳娜！我们来看望你啦！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E9915567041DBD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322101002:0":{"text":"Chippy, yelling like that is rude! Just knock on her door!","source_cn":"满满，这样喊太失礼了，要先敲门！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79E3171C385FD4C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep3/quest_story/13221020.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1322102001:0":{"text":"Is no one there?","source_cn":"咦？没有人在吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81F82A5700BAE772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322102002:0":{"text":"Maybe Carolina went out for a walk.","source_cn":"或许卡列琳娜出来散步了，咱们在周围找找看吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A2C809D74689BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep3/quest_story/13221030.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1322103001:0":{"text":"Look! Carolina's over there!","source_cn":"看，卡列琳娜在那里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA17E2EEF5079459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep3/quest_story/13221040.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221040","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1322104001:1":{"text":"Greetings, Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. What brings you here so suddenly? Did something happen?","source_cn":"你好，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xABE9DDF41270B56B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Greetings, Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. What brings you here so suddenly? Did something happen?","female":"Greetings, Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. What brings you here so suddenly? Did something happen?","variant_male_record_index":"150666","variant_female_record_index":"150667","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322104002:1":{"text":"No, we simply came by to check in on you, Carolina. How are things going with you and Callan?","source_cn":"不是啦！我们只是想来看看你而已。卡列琳娜，你和铐兰最近...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27733EBEADC6156A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322104003:1":{"text":"Thank you for your concern. I'm doing well, and Callan seems to have returned to normal.","source_cn":"谢谢你们的关心，我很好，铐兰哥哥看起来也恢复了正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C0F2B64FD1DC76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1322104003":{"text":"Thank you for your concern. I'm doing well, and Callan seems to have returned to normal.","source_cn":"谢谢你们的关心，我很好，铐兰哥哥看起来也恢复了正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C0F2B64FD1DC76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322104004:1":{"text":"Actually, I'm not worrying about myself.","source_cn":"其实……我并不是为了自己的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88BA832F40817B9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322104006:1":{"text":"The moment news of the Frost Furie broke, panic erupted. The Archduke, the Princess, the Hierophant—all were lost in quick succession. The duchy spiraled into chaos, and the temple faced a vicious attack, leaving it barely able to function.","source_cn":"冰之恶魔的事情传开之后，人们都很恐慌。大公、公主、大主...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B1DA8633FF34C08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322104007:1":{"text":"Dura above, I wish to help Whiteridge through these turbulent times. But the truth is, people are too afraid of the Graveborn to accept it.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，我……希望能帮助白山的人们度过这段混乱的日子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x324CF0279403518F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322104008:1":{"text":"Even though we're not evil, changing the deep-rooted beliefs passed down through generations in Whiteridge might be harder than defeating the Frost Furie herself.","source_cn":"虽然我们并不邪恶，可想要改变在白山流传了千百年的认知，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD63127427F5D97C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322104009:1":{"text":"If you're willing, I hope you can lend your strength to help everyone. I'll do everything in my power to stand by you and contribute.","source_cn":"如果你们愿意，我希望你们能向大家伸出援手，我会尽全力协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3762FF54772BD355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322104010:1":{"text":"Perhaps, in time, people will realize the Graveborn aren't inherently evil. I dream of a day when fear no longer divides us and we can coexist peacefully.","source_cn":"或许……人们会因此开始重新认识亡灵。终有一天，大家会不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE370A0F043E5BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322104011:1":{"text":"Yes, Carolina. We'll definitely help you.","source_cn":"我明白了，卡列琳娜。我们一定会帮忙的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BB8C9586783B361","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322104012:1":{"text":"Thank you. May the goddess bless you all.","source_cn":"谢谢，愿艾雅保佑你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8D4F926F66C450B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"But you look worried.","source_cn":"但你看上去在发愁","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1F671AF29462CED3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But you look worried.","female":"But you look worried.","variant_male_record_index":"69878","variant_female_record_index":"69879","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322104005:1":{"text":"It's okay, Carolina. We're friends. You can always ask for anything.","source_cn":"没关系的，卡列琳娜，不用觉得不好意思！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79FE3273D1515E06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choi